{"c":{"36309":["Narrator",null,"b36309-6KM0riV4lqfN.jpg","This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven't been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work.",2200],"280138":["Nagomi Wahira","Female","b280138-lx72YdJwb69p.png","A fresh-faced 17-year-old girl who moves to Akiba to become a maid cafe waitress after seeing a flier from the Oinky Doink Cafe.",522],"280139":["Ranko Mannen","Female","b280139-ggy1EZrWa0up.png","A 35-year-old woman with a stern, professional demeanor at all times, whether serving patrons at the cafe or gunning down rival maids. Despite being introduced as a rookie at the Oinky Doink Cafe, Ranko has a history in the world of the Akiba Maids stretching back over a decade.",597],"285827":["Yume Hiiragi","Female","b285827-BtdYQTPPiEMp.jpg","One of the veteran maids at the Oinky Doink Cafe, with a small but dedicated following, able to read other people and turn on her charm as needed.",157],"285831":["Shino Gotou","Female","b285831-bAVuVH5jPthV.png","A tanned gyaru and another veteran maid at the Oinky Doink Cafe.",111],"285833":["Yasuko Yaegashi","Female","b285833-elseeD3uLCi2.png","The Manager of the Oinky Doink Cafe. Her bad luck with money puts her in debt to the Creatureland group, and her schemes to get out of debt make things worse.",134],"285834":["Okachimachi",null,"b285834-LVnItBYQ0srh.png","The mascot of the Oinky Doink Cafe, despite being a panda instead of a pig. Their true identity is currently unknown, but Okachimachi does support the other cafe members as needed.",69],"289065":["Michiyo","Female","b289065-uN6Mto4LOF99.jpg","",6],"289066":["Taishou","Male","b289066-lA2NpFDTCj70.png","",12],"289067":["Toritateya","Male","b289067-jSZMy3rgrE1k.png","A hard-boiled man dressed like a stereotypical otaku who serves as the middleman for the Creatureland group and the various maid cafes in Akihabara under its umbrella.",8],"289068":["Chuki-chuki Tsuki-chan Tenchou","Female","b289068-77